      "facts": [
        {
          "id": "k_keen_1u9",
          "text": "Everyone here is excited. We are just waiting to go live.",
          "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
          "status": "claim"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_installer_gone_1u9",
          "text": "A local installer put the dock in, then moved on. He no longer answers calls.",
          "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
          "status": "told"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_not_commissioned_1u9",
          "text": "Power and network were tested at install, but no test flight was done because there was no certified pilot on site.",
          "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
          "status": "verified",
          "verified_by": "K_install_note_1u9"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_no_pilot_1u9",
          "text": "Nobody at the estate holds a drone pilot certificate. Dana assumed the system flies itself once switched on.",
          "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
          "status": "told"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_insurer_not_told_1u9",
          "text": "The property insurance requires any new aerial equipment to be notified before use. The dock is not declared.",
          "said_by": "Lucy Pratt",
          "status": "verified",
          "verified_by": "K_insurance_schedule_1u9"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_need_entrances_1u9",
          "text": "What the estate needs is night patrol of the two entrances. The sales pitch was about mapping the whole estate, which they do not need.",
          "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
          "status": "told"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_board_pays_1u9",
          "text": "Any spend beyond the original purchase needs a vote of the residents’ board, which meets on the first Monday of each month.",
          "said_by": "Graham Okafor",
          "status": "told"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_board_doubts_1u9",
          "text": "Some residents already ask why they paid for a drone that has never flown.",
          "said_by": "Graham Okafor",
          "status": "told"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_south_unassessed_1u9",
          "text": "The south entrance was raised at install but never assessed for coverage.",
          "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
          "status": "verified",
          "verified_by": "K_install_note_1u9"
        },
        {
          "id": "k_south_wish_1u9",
          "text": "If it works at the north gate, Dana would like a second dock for the south entrance.",
          "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
          "status": "claim"
        }
